.TH "GYRO" "1" "Nov 2026" "Gyro Hosting" "gyro manual"

.SH NAME
gyro-activity-get - Account activity (sign-ins and security events)


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgyro activity get [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Account activity (sign-ins and security events)

.PP
The records of \fBAccount > Activity\fP in the client area (\fB/myaccount/info#activity\fR): sign-ins with IP, location, browser and platform, and account events (password, two-factor, passkey, session and trusted-device changes, profile and address changes ...). Newest first. Only your own account: the key decides the account, there is no account parameter, and sub-account keys get 403. Same privacy as the panel: full IP of your own sign-ins; the raw user agent and stored event data are not returned. Needs the \fBaccount_read\fR permission (Account / read on the key screen; the read-only template includes it). The write log of your API keys stays at \fBGET /cloud/activity\fR\&.

.PP
API: GET /activity (operationId getAccountActivity, scope account_read)


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--all\fP[=false]
	fetch every page

.PP
\fB--from\fP=""
	From this day (YYYY-MM-DD, whole day, Türkiye time) or time (ISO 8601), inclusive

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for get

.PP
\fB--limit\fP=0
	items per page (max 100)

.PP
\fB--page\fP=1
	page number

.PP
\fB--param-lang\fP=""
	Language of \fBtitle\fR (default: the account language) (tr|en)

.PP
\fB--to\fP=""
	Until this day (YYYY-MM-DD, whole day) or time (ISO 8601), inclusive

.PP
\fB--type\fP=""
	login = sign-ins only, action = account events only (all|login|action)


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--api-url\fP=""
	API base URL (env GYRO_API_URL)

.PP
\fB--debug\fP[=false]
	log HTTP requests to stderr (secrets masked)

.PP
\fB--lang\fP=""
	message language: tr or en (default from locale)

.PP
\fB--no-color\fP[=false]
	disable colours (also NO_COLOR)

.PP
\fB--no-header\fP[=false]
	omit the table header

.PP
\fB-o\fP, \fB--output\fP=""
	output format: table, json, yaml, text

.PP
\fB-p\fP, \fB--profile\fP=""
	profile to use (env GYRO_PROFILE)

.PP
\fB--query\fP=""
	JMESPath query applied to the result

.PP
\fB-q\fP, \fB--quiet\fP[=false]
	print only ids

.PP
\fB--timeout\fP=0s
	overall timeout, e.g. 30s, 10m

.PP
\fB--wide\fP[=false]
	show all table columns

.PP
\fB-y\fP, \fB--yes\fP[=false]
	do not ask for confirmation


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBgyro-activity(1)\fP
